  "claims": [
    {
      "id": "claim_bc5ffa2998344cda8c54325d9e17e018",
      "statement": "`mcp-server/` is a separate Express MCP deployment that serves a stateless Streamable HTTP protocol at `POST /mcp`; every request is authenticated before a fresh MCP server and transport are created, and GET/DELETE on that endpoint are rejected while `/health` reports success.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://mcp-server/src/app.ts#L1-L48",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:3ae2fd589e2480a4729624a4b3efc455500bbf232217c3db371b2e7149d4987c:"
        },
        {
          "resource": "repo://mcp-server/src/http.ts#L1-L9",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:9126b0c5023038c48e9c842326e1b9a5ebd203fde6c9838f977743e26cc32bf7:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_266a9b83a95742edaa5a90967c021cdf",
      "statement": "The MCP deployment uses its own server-only Supabase service-role client, exits when its URL or service-role key is absent, and does not expose that database credential to partner callers.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://mcp-server/README.md#L11-L12",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:385cc9d9aebe8eb35f1acaa17ec9cbc521427b6e364924d11deb47e7aca16df2:"
        },
        {
          "resource": "repo://mcp-server/src/supabase.ts#L1-L17",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:2311eb3fcd849e93e75a3c8eea036f90a325b75a2eca54aff16ba4be986cfb83:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_3f835f6b4dd14800abe1daafcdc7875c",
      "statement": "Partner token state is persisted in RLS-enabled `api_partners`, `api_keys`, and `api_audit_log` tables: keys bind a partner to one store, store only a unique SHA-256 hash and diagnostic prefix, and track scope, approval, revocation, expiry, and last use; ordinary client access is deny-by-default except for admin policies.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://supabase/migrations/0059_api_keys_mcp.sql#L1-L69",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:7d5d15a11a69b7caa59720b3bd8811d995dcac02fb180e01f41c108eae69fad4:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_65a271d475264009a918558259d4e492",
      "statement": "The administrative issuance helper generates a random `i24_read_` or `i24_write_` token, prints plaintext only at issuance, and outputs SQL that persists only its SHA-256 hash; write-key SQL stamps approval fields while read-key SQL does not.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://mcp-server/scripts/emitir-token.mjs#L1-L18",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:e17fa94be3f9260d44cdb92a3758a03c4f17a3bf6655b46e80dc781873f76643:"
        },
        {
          "resource": "repo://mcp-server/scripts/emitir-token.mjs#L42-L56",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:9037d3f8ce1bab7dda215ce07fcc15cdb39cecfb3fabbbcd54c8b1e5c6ec4344:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_2eabecc621da494397451c2a74dc5d3c",
      "statement": "Authentication strips the Bearer value, requires an `i24_` token, hashes it with SHA-256, and validates it through `api_validar_token`; the database function accepts only active partners with unrevoked, unexpired keys and requires an approved write key for write scope, while write scope also satisfies reads.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://mcp-server/src/auth.ts#L12-L35",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:2a4a3c6a988851f3e73b59ddcb78b88a9357aa9735dc4ebee47c59a6f7468374:"
        },
        {
          "resource": "repo://supabase/migrations/0059_api_keys_mcp.sql#L71-L94",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:588c9ea9e69398149d4bfb4a53528f8bc56c282ffb8dc3323121b33f1169c3e6:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_8c31c2932f0441f3b2610374057c7ab5",
      "statement": "Read access is limited to explicitly enumerated tables and read tools provide paginated listing, lookup, product-name search, and run-location tracking rather than arbitrary table access.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://mcp-server/src/server.ts#L7-L147",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:7a734cb93fd7402782d798ccdd9ac9efe6654cb7ebe9b2ec4645a98bb9cd7670:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_a8b306dcbd2f4eee8e6bce85d941e576",
      "statement": "Write tools are registered only for a write-scoped context and each is additionally gated by the comma-separated `MCP_WRITE_ENABLED` module set, which defaults to no enabled write modules.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://mcp-server/.env.example#L14-L17",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:bb4b8e0bbbb095af729a0c67527badad2242b602f7b701ea9a2f1a3f8baef8e0:"
