    },
    {
      "id": "claim_f4211096260f4a39b7266102f7f19455",
      "statement": "Completion of database-attempted write tools records key, store, tool, parameters, outcome, error, and IP through `api_registrar_uso`, which inserts an audit row and stamps key last use; disabled-module rejections are also recorded before returning a tool error.",
